  dialogues:
  - text: Here you are! I don't know when do you come back so i put the calling as
      a quest..
    npcId: vex
  - text: Vex pull out a tin box from his chest.
    npcId: 
  - text: This is what i found next to you the day i found you.
    npcId: vex
  - text: Inside the tin box, there is a signet ring with a crest of a tree over
      2 crossed swords; an empty silver locket; a scrap of paper.
    npcId: 
  - text: 'You read the paper: "Hide the child, keeping his name!"'
    npcId: 
  - text: I did not tell anyone about this before, but you are growth. So I pass
      these thing to you to decide.
    npcId: vex
  - text: You may ask people about it, or follow the paper, keep it secret like me.
    npcId: vex
